url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/professional-student-development/mlu-000002-discipline-assistant-seminar
abstract: >-
  The technical lab of the set. In about 15 minutes participants build a grounded,
  source-citing AI tutor for their own field and see directly what grounding buys them,
  because the notebook asks the same question with and without the source document. Ships
  in two paths — free Google Colab plus Hugging Face, or SageMaker Studio plus Bedrock —
  so faculty keep a working copy after cloud access ends.
